sequenceDiagram
    title UC-16 - Review Meeting Approval
    actor Approver as Assigned Meeting Approver
    participant Page as Meeting Management Page
    participant API as Meeting API
    participant Service as Meeting Service
    participant DB as Database

    Approver->>Page: Choose Approve or Reject
    alt Reject
        Page-->>Approver: Request rejection reason
        Approver->>Page: Enter reason and confirm
    else Approve
        Page-->>Approver: Confirm approval
    end
    Page->>API: POST /api/meetings/{id}/transitions
    API->>Service: Transition(meetingId, action, reason, actor)

    alt Reject reason is missing or exceeds 1000 characters
        Service-->>API: 400 MEETING_REJECTION_REASON_REQUIRED or MEETING_REJECTION_REASON_TOO_LONG
        API-->>Page: Show rejection reason validation
        Page-->>Approver: Keep the decision form open
    else Approve or Reject with a valid reason
        Service->>DB: BEGIN and lock meeting row
        DB-->>Service: Current status and AssignedApproverId

        alt Meeting is missing or caller cannot read it
            Service->>DB: ROLLBACK without writes
            Service-->>API: 404 Not Found
            API-->>Page: Display meeting unavailable
        else Meeting is visible to caller
            Service->>DB: Check active actor, current assignment, and meeting_approver
            DB-->>Service: Current authorization result
            alt Actor is no longer the eligible Assigned Approver
                Service->>DB: ROLLBACK without writes
                Service-->>API: 403 MEETING_ACTION_FORBIDDEN
                API-->>Page: Display access denied
            else Actor is the current eligible Assigned Approver
              alt Meeting is no longer WaitingApproval
                Service->>DB: ROLLBACK without writes
                Service-->>API: 409 MEETING_STATUS_CONFLICT
                API-->>Page: Refresh the current meeting status
              else Decision can proceed
                alt Approve
                Service->>DB: UPDATE status to Approved and INSERT Approve history
                else Reject with valid reason
                Service->>DB: UPDATE status to Rejected and INSERT Reject history with reason
                end

                alt SaveChanges fails
                    DB-->>Service: Persistence error before commit
                    Service->>DB: ROLLBACK the whole transaction
                    Service-->>API: 503 MEETING_WORKFLOW_FAILED
                    API-->>Page: Show retryable decision error
                else Status and one history row are staged
                    DB-->>Service: Pending writes
                    Service->>DB: COMMIT
                    alt Commit fails
                        DB-->>Service: Commit error
                        Service->>DB: ROLLBACK the whole transaction
                        Service-->>API: 503 MEETING_WORKFLOW_FAILED
                        API-->>Page: Show retryable decision error
                    else Commit succeeds
                        DB-->>Service: Status and one history row committed
                        Service-->>API: Transition result
                        API-->>Page: 200 MEETING_TRANSITION_COMPLETED
                        Page-->>Approver: Show decision confirmation
                    end
                end
              end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Service,DB: Status and history commit atomically. Rejection reason is stored in history.
